  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The position vector of center of mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>cm</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;is given as&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>cm</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi>cm</mi></msub><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mi>cm</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi>cm</mi></msub><mo>=</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>coordinate of center of mass&nbsp;&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mi>cm</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo></math>coordinate of center of mass</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>cm</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>cm</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvarian